y":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"A performance issue for the bundled `cloudide.icube-remote-ssh` extension was reported in the VS Code extension samples repository, but it belongs to Trae's bundled remote SSH extension rather than that samples repo.\n\nOriginal report: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-extension-samples/issues/1284\n\nReported environment:\n- Extension: `icube-remote-ssh`\n- Extension version: `0.0.16`\n- OS: `Windows_NT x64 10.0.26200`\n- VS Code version from report: `1.107.1`\n\nThe original report says the user should attach this CPU profile from their machine:\n`C:/Users/Gyuan/AppData/Local/Temp/cloudide.icube-remote-ssh-unresponsive.cpuprofile.txt`\n\nI could not patch this directly because `cloudide.icube-remote-ssh` appears to be a bundled/internal extension, not a standalone public source repository. Please triage this in the Trae codebase or ask the original reporter for the CPU profile.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2539/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}